    predicate: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related
    rationale: The source identifies starting, stopping or changing a third-party deduction as a supersession of an earlier decision.
    evidence:
    - page: page/dmg-vol8-ch46/0029
      quote: "46134 When a decision is made to\n\n\n1. start or\n\n\n2. stop or\n\n\n3. change\n\n\na third party deduction, this will be by way of a supersession of an earlier decision (see DMG Chapter 04)."
      locator: DMG 46134
  - target: term/dmg-evidence-assessment
    predicate: http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#related
    rationale: The source requires enquiries and an opportunity for evidence where liability for a debt is disputed.
    evidence:
    - page: page/dmg-vol8-ch46/0029
      quote: "46137 A debt may be disputed by the claimant or partner. This is a factor for the DM to consider when\ndeciding whether they are liable to pay the debt. Although the Department cannot get involved in the\ndispute, enquiries should be made of the third party."
      locator: DMG 46137
    - page: page/dmg-vol8-ch46/0029
      quote: "46138 Give the claimant the opportunity to provide evidence to support any claim that the debt is not\nliable to be paid."
      locator: DMG 46138
